{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155810/extras/dfe048433aa2a15295ef553327a463ef.poster.avif?t=1774657914\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155810/extras/dfe048433aa2a15295ef553327a463ef.webm?t=1774657914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155810/extras/dfe048433aa2a15295ef553327a463ef.mp4?t=1774657914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;I killed the demon. Our family is saved now, right?&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A tragic family incident that unfolded in an apartment with windows covered in black plastic. You must rearrange the scattered fragments of truth to confront the madness that consumed an ordinary household.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A psychological horror thriller based on a true story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are the sentences you piece together salvation, or purification?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why did a seemingly normal family lock themselves in darkness?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A psychological horror text adventure that traces how the safest place\u2014'home'\u2014turned into 'hell.'</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2026, the year their son is released from prison.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can he return to his 'ordinary home'?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is a work of fiction reconstructed from real events.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOW TO PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel back in time. As you piece together the scattered fragments of memory, you will face a truth you don't want to believe.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drag and arrange sentences in the correct order.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But to proceed to the next chapter, you must answer questions. The answers are hidden somewhere in the story. If you haven't read carefully, you'll need to go back and check.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every piece you fit together reveals the outline of truth.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4155810?t=1774657914","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4155810?t=1774657914","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155810/347fc7d343a8c36dfd3999840e41d07e659a575d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774657914","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155810/347fc7d343a8c36dfd3999840e41d07e659a575d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774657914","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4264360,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155810/extras/dfe048433aa2a15295ef553327a463ef.poster.avif?t=1774657914\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155810/extras/dfe048433aa2a15295ef553327a463ef.webm?t=1774657914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4155810/extras/dfe048433aa2a15295ef553327a463ef.mp4?t=1774657914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;I killed the demon. Our family is saved now, right?&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A tragic family incident that unfolded in an apartment with windows covered in black plastic. You must rearrange the scattered fragments of truth to confront the madness that consumed an ordinary household.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A psychological horror thriller based on a true story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are the sentences you piece together salvation, or purification?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why did a seemingly normal family lock themselves in darkness?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A psychological horror text adventure that traces how the safest place\u2014'home'\u2014turned into 'hell.'</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2026, the year their son is released from prison.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can he return to his 'ordinary home'?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is a work of fiction reconstructed from real events.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOW TO PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel back in time. As you piece together the scattered fragments of memory, you will face a truth you don't want to believe.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_par